Build requirements for the ESP32-S3 smart-speaker board:

    CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_16MB=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM_MODE_OCT=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM_TYPE_AUTO=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM_SPEED_80M=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM_BOOT_INIT=y
    CONFIG_SPIRAM_USE_MALLOC=y

The deployed image was built with ESP-IDF 5.5 for `esp32s3`. The 8 MB octal
PSRAM setting is required for backward-compatible buffered AI speech.
